# Gardenize: only a creature its controller controls triggers the charge counter. Bot2's Ornithopter dies to Bot1's Flame
# Slash on turn 3 and adds none; Bot1's own Ornithopter dies to Bot2's Flame Slash on turn 4 and adds one. On turn 5 the
# first main phase's trigger adds {G}, which casts Llanowar Elves (charge counters are not removed).

